"USAGE: /exec [-o] <command> - Executes the specified command and displays the "
"output in the chat buffer. If -o is specified, the output is sent to all "
"members of the chat."
msgstr "用法: /exec [-o] <指令> - 執行指定的指令，並將結果送至聊天緩衝區。如有 -o ，結果將傳送給聊天內的所有成員。"

